  "solution": "Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>400</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>144</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>H</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra khoảng cách từ điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> đến chân tường là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m.",
